MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e6016940cf8948099c1572c6e80fcd3b, type: 3}
  m_Name: RunMenuContent
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RunMenuContent
  Weapons:
  - Weapon: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9d5f6ee1a7b946c490f7773a86f0a31c, type: 2}
    Summary: 
    Description: 
    PathADescription: Hits leave burning fuel puddles, and manual fire burns enemies
      for longer. The ability leaves a large, lingering pool beneath you.
    PathBDescription: Replaces burning with chilling attacks that slow enemies. Sustained
      manual fire strengthens the slow, while the ability freezes enemies before
      leaving them heavily slowed.
  - Weapon: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7991edf7f844c1b4abbdf23bd13bf5c8, type: 2}
    Summary: 
    Description: 
    PathADescription: Replaces bursts with continuous fire that accelerates as heat
      rises. Manual fire gains a larger magazine, while the ability unleashes a sustained
      barrage.
    PathBDescription: Fires powerful piercing rounds that excel against elites and
      bosses. Manual shots reward weak-point hits, while the ability charges a devastating
      piercing shot.
  - Weapon: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 06695e9a9e2d050489bea57d214585ff, type: 2}
    Summary: 
    Description: 
    PathADescription: Regular rockets produce wider blasts with stronger knockback.
      Enemies caught in explosions temporarily take more damage from all sources.
    PathBDescription: Trades blast size and knockback for a forward spray of fragments
      that can hit alongside the explosion. The ability launches a massive rocket
      that bursts into smaller rockets.
  - Weapon: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 95e4ff2de6a64faba44ee0ca803ef37b, type: 2}
    Summary: 
    Description: 
    PathADescription: Shells burst in midair, scattering projectiles across a wide
      area. Multiple fragments can hit one target, while the ability rains projectiles
      over the selected area.
    PathBDescription: Shells pass through enemies, land, and explode repeatedly.
      The ability drops a barrage whose shells detonate together in successive waves.
  - Weapon: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 125e543fc3a34c17bca6d9436a372ad3, type: 2}
    Summary: 
    Description: 
    PathADescription: Adds blades as the weapon levels up. They orbit you in automatic
      mode, strike rapidly in manual mode, and add extra thrusts to the ability.
    PathBDescription: Trades knockback for harder-hitting attacks and a faster orbit.
      The ability becomes an invulnerable damaging dash that extends whenever you
      hit another target.
